Package: datareceipt
Title: Pull Your Data Receipt Data into R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("David", "Keyes", , "david@rfortherestofus.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Data Receipt <https://datareceipt.io> collects validated
    spreadsheets from the people you ask. This package pulls what they sent
    into R as typed tibbles: list your requests, read a request's column
    spec, and get every accepted row across all submissions in one call.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/dgkeyes/datareceipt, https://dgkeyes.github.io/datareceipt
BugReports: https://github.com/dgkeyes/datareceipt/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    cli,
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    rlang,
    tibble,
    vctrs
Suggests:
    httptest2,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
